This Codex adaptation is inspired by Software Factory for Claude Code (v2)
by ZazenCodes / Alex, in zazencodes/zazencodes-season-3:
https://github.com/zazencodes/zazencodes-season-3/tree/main/src/software-factory-claude-code-v2

Reference inspected at repository commit c467603.
The original Claude implementation remains in the upstream repository linked above.

This adaptation replaces Claude-specific orchestration with Python and OpenAI
Codex CLI execution, adds GitHub/GitLab adapters, and removes autonomous merge
capability. It is provided under the GNU General Public License version 3;
